1712,"l":"doctor_start","c":"Module 0, the doctor (a clinic, infirmary or hospital: healing, an exam and cures for diseases); its own bytes are $CA00-$CDE6, the same on all four sides. The game's class-6 square handler loads and calls it for a record whose action byte is $80 ($8839-$884E); seven of the 42 map snapshots have such a record, each reached through a class-10 entrance square that turns itself into it when the party answers Y to \"Enter new location (Y/N)?\". The record at ($5F/$60): +0 $80; +1/+2 $FD $FD, which the game applies when the module returns (game $8840: LDA #1, JMP $B105, alter_square on the party's square; $FD puts back the entrance square kept in $AD/$AE and returns carry clear, which ends the game's square loop); +3 the map message shown as the greeting; +4 the price of one CON point; +5 the price of the exam; +6 the price of one cure (dollars, 0-255 each); +7..+$12 the name, 11 characters and a zero. Keeps the shown picture $AB and the animation flag $AC on the stack, copies the name over the location name at $F4D0, shows picture 0 from the buffer at $E000 (show_picture_e000 $041C, which prints that name under it) and goes on at doctor_ask.","t":"code","b":[165,171],"m":"lda","oa":171,"o":"picture_number"},{"a":51714,"t":"code","b":[72],"m":"pha"},{"a":51715,"t":"code","b":[165,172],"m":"lda","oa":172,"o":"picture_animating"},{"a":51717,"t":"code","b":[72],"m":"pha"},{"a":51718,"t":"code","b":[160,7],"m":"ldy","o":"#$07"},{"a":51720,"t":"code","b":[162,0],"m":"ldx","o":"#$00"},{"a":51722,"l":"b_CA0A","t":"code","b":[177,95],"m":"lda","oa":95,"o":"(map_record_ptr),y","x":[51731]},{"a":51724,"t":"code","b":[157,208,244],"m":"sta","oa":62672,"o":"picture_caption,x"},{"a":51727,"t":"code","b":[200],"m":"iny"},{"a":51728,"t":"code","b":[232],"m":"inx"},{"a":51729,"t":"code","b":[224,12],"m":"cpx","o":"#$0C"},{"a":51731,"t":"code","b":[208,245],"m":"bne","oa":51722,"o":"b_CA0A"},{"a":51733,"t":"code","b":[169,0],"m":"lda","o":"#$00"},{"a":51735,"t":"code","b":[32,28,4],"m":"jsr","oa":1052,"o":"api_show_picture_e000"},{"a":51738,"l":"doctor_ask","c":"Asks who is treated: redraws the roster (roster_show $02B7), offers the exam again (doctor_exam_flag = 1) and withdraws the cure and heal offers, prints the record's greeting (map message +3 through print_map_message $0317; the greetings open with code 7, which clears the text window) and \"Who wants treatment?\" (message 23), and waits for a member number (pick_member $02AE). Left-arrow goes to doctor_leave. Otherwise the number goes into doctor_patient, that roster line is highlighted (roster_line_highlight $02C9, which selects the member) and a member whose CON is exactly 0 (con_is_zero $02BD: dead, the roster's skull) gets \"<name> is beyond my help.\" (message 9, then the (RETURN) wait of its code 6) and the question is asked again; anyone else goes to doctor_offer.","t":"code","b":[32,183,2],"m":"jsr","oa":695,"o":"api_roster_show","x":[51788,51838]},{"a":51741,"t":"code","b":[162,1],"m":"ldx","o":"#$01"},{"a":51743,"t":"code","b":[142,91,202],"m":"stx","oa":51803,"o":"doctor_exam_flag"},{"a":51746,"t":"code","b":[202],"m":"dex"},{"a":51747,"t":"code","b":[142,121,202],"m":"stx","oa":51833,"o":"doctor_cure_flag"},{"a":51750,"t":"code","b":[142,123,202],"m":"stx","oa":51835,"o":"doctor_heal_flag"},{"a":51753,"t":"code","b":[160,3],"m":"ldy","o":"#$03"},{"a":51755,"t":"code","b":[177,95],"m":"lda","oa":95,"o":"(map_record_ptr),y"},{"a":51757,"t":"code","b":[32,23,3],"m":"jsr","oa":791,"o":"api_print_map_message"},{"a":51760,"t":"code","b":[169,23],"m":"lda","o":"#$17"},{"a":51762,"t":"code","b":[32,73,204],"m":"jsr","oa":52297,"o":"doctor_print"},{"a":51765,"t":"code","b":[32,174,2],"m":"jsr","oa":686,"o":"api_pick_member"},{"a":51768,"t":"code","b":[201,0],"m":"cmp","o":"#$00"},{"a":51770,"t":"code","b":[240,19],"m":"beq","oa":51791,"o":"doctor_leave"},{"a":51772,"t":"code","b":[141,130,202],"m":"sta","oa":51842,"o":"doctor_patient"},{"a":51775,"t":"code","