 while an exam is on offer to this patient, set by doctor_ask ($CA1F) and cleared once one has been paid for ($CBEB). Read here, at $CA75 (the offers), $CA98 (E)xam on the menu) and $CBCC (the E key).","note":"inside the item at $CA5A","x":[51743,51829,51864,52172,52203]},{"a":51804,"t":"code","b":[208,13],"m":"bne","oa":51819,"o":"b_CA6B"},{"a":51806,"t":"code","b":[160,40],"m":"ldy","o":"#$28"},{"a":51808,"t":"code","b":[177,102],"m":"lda","oa":102,"o":"(character_ptr),y"},{"a":51810,"t":"code","b":[240,7],"m":"beq","oa":51819,"o":"b_CA6B"},{"a":51812,"t":"code","b":[169,1],"m":"lda","o":"#$01"},{"a":51814,"t":"code","b":[141,121,202],"m":"sta","oa":51833,"o":"doctor_cure_flag"},{"a":51817,"t":"code","b":[208,0],"m":"bne","oa":51819,"o":"b_CA6B"},{"a":51819,"l":"b_CA6B","t":"code","b":[32,116,3],"m":"jsr","oa":884,"o":"api_con_is_full","x":[51804,51810,51817]},{"a":51822,"t":"code","b":[240,5],"m":"beq","oa":51829,"o":"b_CA75"},{"a":51824,"t":"code","b":[169,1],"m":"lda","o":"#$01"},{"a":51826,"t":"code","b":[141,123,202],"m":"sta","oa":51835,"o":"doctor_heal_flag"},{"a":51829,"l":"b_CA75","t":"code","b":[173,91,202],"m":"lda","oa":51803,"o":"doctor_exam_flag","x":[51822]},{"a":51832,"t":"code","b":[9,0],"m":"ora","o":"#$00"},{"a":51833,"t":"note","l":"doctor_cure_flag","c":"Operand of the first ORA #imm, at $CA78: 1 while C)uring is on offer, set by doctor_offer when the exam has been done and the disease byte +$28 is non-zero ($CA66), cleared by doctor_ask ($CA23) and when the last disease is cured ($CBBD). Read at $CA8E (C)uring on the menu) and $CB59 (the C key).","note":"inside the item at $CA78","x":[51747,51814,51854,52057,52157]},{"a":51834,"t":"code","b":[9,0],"m":"ora","o":"#$00"},{"a":51835,"t":"note","l":"doctor_heal_flag","c":"Operand of the second ORA #imm, at $CA7A: 1 while H)ealing is on offer (CON not equal to MAXCON, set at $CA72), cleared by doctor_ask ($CA26) and when healing reaches MAXCON ($CB4B). Read at $CAA9 (H)ealing on the menu) and $CAD6 (the H key). The LDA and two ORAs leave A non-zero when any of the three offers stands.","note":"inside the item at $CA7A","x":[51750,51826,51881,51926,52043]},{"a":51836,"t":"code","b":[208,11],"m":"bne","oa":51849,"o":"doctor_menu"},{"a":51838,"l":"doctor_ask_again","t":"code","b":[76,26,202],"m":"jmp","oa":51738,"o":"doctor_ask","x":[51902]},{"a":51841,"l":"doctor_pool","c":"P on the doctor's menu: moves every other member's cash to the patient (pool_cash $038F with A = doctor_patient, which ends with the patient selected) and shows the offers again (doctor_offer).","t":"code","b":[169,0],"m":"lda","o":"#$00","x":[51906]},{"a":51842,"t":"note","l":"doctor_patient","c":"Operand of the LDA #imm at $CA81: the patient's position in the party (1-7), stored at $CA3C after pick_member; read at $CAEC, $CB40, $CB50, $CBB4 and $CBC3 to select that member, redraw its roster line and pool the party's cash to it.","note":"inside the item at $CA81","x":[51772,51948,52032,52048,52148,52163]},{"a":51843,"t":"code","b":[32,143,3],"m":"jsr","oa":911,"o":"api_pool_cash"},{"a":51846,"t":"code","b":[76,90,202],"m":"jmp","oa":51802,"o":"doctor_offer"},{"a":51849,"l":"doctor_menu","c":"The doctor's menu: message 10 (code 4 clears the window, then \"Well <name>, I would recommend:\"), C)uring (message 13) while doctor_cure_flag is set, E)xam $ and the price at record +5 (message 11, print_byte $02F6) while doctor_exam_flag is set, H)ealing (message 12) while doctor_heal_flag is set; then flush_line ($0264) and the cash line (doctor_show_cash). Keys (wait_key $022F): left-arrow back to doctor_ask, P doctor_pool, H doctor_heal (only with the heal offer, $CAD6), C doctor_cure, E doctor_exam (each of those two checks its own flag); any other key is ignored.","t":"code","b":[169,10],"m":"lda","o":"#$0A","x":[51836]},{"a":51851,"t":"code","b":[32,73,204],"m":"jsr","oa":52297,"o":"doctor_print"},{"a":51854,"t":"code","b":[173,121,202],"m":"lda","oa":51833,"o":"doctor_cure_flag"},{"a":51857,"